{"unit_id":"ToBeWin__DSH-Skin-Studio#card-zh","repo":"ToBeWin/DSH-Skin-Studio","commit":"ace2e57915a28edb3b352002b14d86253ee49fd1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Skin Studio（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DeepSeek Harness 更换整体界面主题，并可制作个人皮肤。它通过公开的浏览器主题运行时注册十款预设配色，并在设置页面提供皮肤选择和自定义画布。你可以调整明暗模式、背景与文字颜色、强调色和图片氛围，上传本地壁纸并裁切取景，再将组合应用到工作区，也可恢复默认外观。适合想个性化 DSH Web 工作区的用户；无需 API Key 或外部账号，自定义图片与配色保存在本机浏览器。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:145-266","client/client.js:777-1010","client/client.js:533-608"]}
{"unit_id":"ToBeWin__DSH-Skin-Studio#card-en","repo":"ToBeWin/DSH-Skin-Studio","commit":"ace2e57915a28edb3b352002b14d86253ee49fd1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Skin Studio adds ten preset themes and a custom skin editor to DeepSeek Harness Web. Choose light or dark mode, adjust colors, upload and frame a wallpaper, then apply it or restore the default. No API key or account is needed; custom images and colors stay in browser storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:145-266","client/client.js:777-1010","client/client.js:533-608"]}
