{"unit_id":"ToBeWin__DSH-Skin-Studio#feature-5","repo":"ToBeWin/DSH-Skin-Studio","commit":"ace2e57915a28edb3b352002b14d86253ee49fd1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Skin Studio 的功能「记住主题」：所选预设主题 ID 存入浏览器本地存储，自定义图片和配色通过 IndexedDB 保存；也能恢复默认外观。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:533-608","client/client.js:962-978"]}
